Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Social Networking|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Blogs Demo
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	When User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Social Activity|
	And SocialActivity enable Blogs CP
	And SocialActivity configure Action CP
		|contributionIncrement|2|
		|contributionLimitValue|2|
		|participationIncrement|2|
		|participationLimitValue|2|
		|userAction|Adds a Comment|
	And SocialActivity remove Action CP
		|userAction|Reads a Blog|
	And SocialActivity remove Action CP
		|userAction|Subscribes to a Blog|
	And SocialActivity configure Action CP
		|participationIncrement|0|
		|userAction|Votes on a Blog|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|User Statistics|
	And these variables
		|key_portletName|User Statistics|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'There are no active users for this period.' at locator 'Portlet#BODY'
	And Page add
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And SocialActivity view PG Via User Statistics
		|contributionScore|Contribution Score: 0 (Total: 0)|
		|participationScore|Participation Score: 5 (Total: 5)|
		|userName|Test Test|
		|userRank|Rank: 1|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntryComment add
		|entryComment|Blogs Entry Comment 1|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And SocialActivity view PG Via User Statistics
		|contributionScore|Contribution Score: 0 (Total: 0)|
		|participationScore|Participation Score: 7 (Total: 7)|
		|userName|Test Test|
		|userRank|Rank: 1|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntryComment add
		|entryComment|Blogs Entry Comment 2|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And SocialActivity view PG Via User Statistics
		|contributionScore|Contribution Score: 0 (Total: 0)|
		|participationScore|Participation Score: 9 (Total: 9)|
		|userName|Test Test|
		|userRank|Rank: 1|
	And User logout PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsEntryComment add PG As Guest
		|entryComment|Guest Blogs Entry Comment|
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|userEmailAddress|guest@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|Guest|
	And User login PG
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntryComment add
		|entryComment|Blogs Entry Comment from userfn|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And SocialActivity view PG Via User Statistics
		|contributionScore|Contribution Score: 2 (Total: 2)|
		|participationScore|Participation Score: 9 (Total: 9)|
		|userName|Test Test|
		|userRank|Rank: 1|
	And SocialActivity view PG Via User Statistics
		|contributionScore|Contribution Score: 0 (Total: 0)|
		|participationScore|Participation Score: 2 (Total: 2)|
		|userName|userfn userln|
		|userRank|Rank: 2|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntryComment add
		|entryComment|Blogs Entry Comment 3|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And SocialActivity view PG Via User Statistics
		|contributionScore|Contribution Score: 2 (Total: 2)|
		|participationScore|Participation Score: 9 (Total: 9)|
		|userName|Test Test|
		|userRank|Rank: 1|
	Then SocialActivity view PG Via User Statistics
		|contributionScore|Contribution Score: 0 (Total: 0)|
		|participationScore|Participation Score: 2 (Total: 2)|
		|userName|userfn userln|
		|userRank|Rank: 2|
Scenario: Localization
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SocialactivityUsecase#Localization|
	When Page add
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Language Selector|
	And ProductMenuHelper expand Panel Control Panel
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|French (France)|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And Page goto SA Localized CP
		|adminLocalized|Administration du portail|
		|portletCategoryName|Paramètres|
		|portletName|Activité sociale|
	And AssertVisible at locator 'ControlMenu#HEADER_TITLE'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|Japanese (Japan)|
	And Page goto SA Localized CP
		|adminLocalized|システム管理|
		|portletCategoryName|編集|
		|portletName|ソーシャルアクティビティ|
	And AssertVisible at locator 'ControlMenu#HEADER_TITLE'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|Portuguese (Brazil)|
	And Page goto SA Localized CP
		|adminLocalized|Administração|
		|portletCategoryName|Configurar|
		|portletName|Atividade Social|
	And AssertVisible at locator 'ControlMenu#HEADER_TITLE'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Social Activity Page|
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|English (United States)|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Social Activity|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	Then AssertSelectedLabel the value 'English (United States)' at locator 'MyAccount#LANGUAGE_SELECT'
Scenario: Save User Statistics Configuration
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|User Statistics Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|User Statistics Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|User Statistics|
	And these variables
		|key_portletName|User Statistics|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'There are no active users for this period.' at locator 'Portlet#BODY'
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|User Statistics|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'UserStatisticsConfiguration#CONFIGURATION_IFRAME'
	And Uncheck at locator 'Checkbox#RANK_BY_CONTRIBUTION'
	And Uncheck at locator 'Checkbox#RANK_BY_PARTICIPATION'
	And Uncheck at locator 'Checkbox#SHOW_HEADER_TEXT'
	And Uncheck at locator 'Checkbox#SHOW_TOTALS'
	And Uncheck at locator 'Checkbox#DISPLAY_ADDITIONAL_ACTIVITY_COUNTERS'
	And PortletEntry save
	And SelectFrameTop the value 'relative=top'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|User Statistics Page|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|User Statistics|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#DIALOG'
	And AssertNotChecked at locator 'Checkbox#RANK_BY_CONTRIBUTION'
	And AssertNotChecked at locator 'Checkbox#RANK_BY_PARTICIPATION'
	And AssertNotChecked at locator 'Checkbox#SHOW_HEADER_TEXT'
	And AssertNotChecked at locator 'Checkbox#SHOW_TOTALS'
	And AssertNotChecked at locator 'Checkbox#DISPLAY_ADDITIONAL_ACTIVITY_COUNTERS'
	Then SelectFrameTop the value 'relative=top'
Scenario: View Activity Via Group Statistics
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Group Statistics Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Group Statistics Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Group Statistics|
	And these variables
		|key_portletName|Group Statistics|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Please configure this portlet and select at least one activity counter.' at locator 'Portlet#BODY'
	And SocialActivity update Group Statistics Configuration
		|chartType|column diagram|
		|chartWidth|55%|
		|dataRange|last 12 months|
		|displayActivityCounterName|blog entries of This site's users|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Social Activity|
	And SocialActivity enable Blogs CP
	And Navigator open URL
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry1 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry1 Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry2 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry2 Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry3 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry3 Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Group Statistics Page|
	Then SocialActivity view PG Via Group Statistics
		|currentValue|3|
		|siteStatistics|Users' Blog Entries|